#: ../../source/index.md:5 c2c9e7f490354d37b2ef9fa06ecdda44
msgid ""
"FiveAges team; FA wheeled-arm humanoids (W2/W2R/S2/S2R) + dual-arm "
"systems. W1/W2/S2 **descriptions** are public; **W2R / S2R remotes are "
"not open**."
msgstr ""
"FiveAges 团队；FA 轮臂人形（W2/W2R/S2/S2R）+ 双臂系统。W1/W2/S2 **描述**已公开；**W2R / S2R"
"远端尚未开放**。"

#: ../../source/index.md:30 695056756dfa4881976c961483b25274
msgid ""
"Start with the [public path](1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md) if "
"you're new. Internal users should read [fa-deploy-ws "
"setup](1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md) after getting familiar with "
"the stack."
msgstr ""
"如果你是新用户，请从[公开路径](1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md)开始。内部用户在熟悉技术栈之后，应阅读"
" [fa-deploy-ws 配置](1-getting_started/4-fa_deploy_ws.md)。"

